<view class="page cashier-page" style="{{brandStyle}}">
  <view class="amount-card" wx:if="{{orderNo}}">
    <view class="amount-card__label">应付金额</view>
    <view class="amount-card__value">¥{{amountText}}</view>
    <view class="amount-card__order">订单号 {{orderNo}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="pay-switch" wx:if="{{!payEnabled && orderNo}}">
    <image src="/assets/icons/shield-primary.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text>线上支付入口已预留；若商户号未配置，可切换到店付款</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card method-card" wx:if="{{orderNo}}">
    <view class="method {{item.key === selected ? 'is-selected' : ''}} {{item.disabled ? 'is-disabled' : ''}}"
      wx:for="{{methods}}" wx:key="key" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectMethod">
      <view class="radio"></view>
      <image class="method__icon" src="{{item.icon}}" mode="aspectFit" />
      <view class="method__body">
        <view class="method__name">{{item.name}}</view>
        <view class="method__desc">{{item.disabled ? item.disabledText : item.desc}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="trust-note" wx:if="{{orderNo}}">
    定金在接宠完成前取消可全额退回；选择到店付款不会影响门店确认预约。
  </view>

  <view class="cashier-bar" wx:if="{{orderNo}}">
    <button class="btn-primary" disabled="{{submitting}}" bindtap="submit">{{submitting ? "处理中..." : actionText}}</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="state state--card">
    <image class="state__icon" src="/assets/icons/tab-order.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="state__text">没有找到订单信息</view>
    <view class="state__hint">可返回预约页重新提交</view>
  </view>
</view>
